++- `6 ÷ 0 =` → `Cannot divide by zero`; then `4` → `4`, `+ 6 =` → `10`.
++- `50 + 10 % =` → `55`, `9 x²` → `81`, `8 ¹/x` → `0.125`, `9 ²√x` → `3`,
++  `123 ⌫` → `12`, `7 ±` → `-7`.
